{"seconds": 33.6, "exit": 0, "final": "Excellent! I found it. **Rxh2+** wins by force because the h2 pawn is pinned. Here's the winning line:\n\n**Best move: Rxh2+**\n\n**Main line:** Rxh2+ Kxh2 Rh8+ Bh6 Rxh6#\n\n**Motif: pin**\n\n**Coaching note:**\nThe h2 pawn was pinned to White's king by your rook on h8. When a piece is pinned, it becomes a target\u2014you can capture it for free. Rxh2+ forces the king to recapture, then Rh8+ drives the bishop to h6, where Rxh6# is checkmate. Pinned pieces are always weak; look for ways to capture them or use the pin to create threats the opponent can't escape.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Rxh2+\", \"line\": [\"Rxh2+\", \"Kxh2\", \"Rh8+\", \"Bh6\", \"Rxh6#\"], \"motifs\": [\"pin\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "d8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "h8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "e2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "f1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "a1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "e3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/R4R1K b - - 0 21", "square": "h1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/pN1p1pp1/6p1/3PP3/2p5/4B3/PP2nPPP/